### 1. Leave Policy
- **Annual Leave**  
  - Full‑time employees receive **20 days of paid annual leave** each calendar year.  
  - Requests must be entered in the HR portal **at least 5 working days before the intended start date**.  
  - Up to **5 unused days** can be carried forward to the next year; any additional unused days are forfeited.

- **Sick Leave**  
  - Employees are entitled to **10 paid sick days** per year, separate from annual leave.  
